## SQ-AC-02 | dragon set 36 armor, 18 toughness
> item replace entity qa armor.head with dragonloot:dragon_helmet
> item replace entity qa armor.chest with dragonloot:dragon_chestplate
> item replace entity qa armor.legs with dragonloot:dragon_leggings
> item replace entity qa armor.feet with dragonloot:dragon_boots
sleep 2
> attribute qa minecraft:generic.armor get
> attribute qa minecraft:generic.armor_toughness get
expect for entity qa is 36
expect armor_toughness for entity qa is 18
> clear qa

## SQ-TL-09 | /cegen lists the generators
> cegen
sleep 3
reject \[cegen\].*(Error|error|failed)
look lists the generators from tools/generators.json with groups (stacks among them)

## SQ-CBJ-05 | Brewin' member switch read on /reload (last: changes the config)
shell sed -i -E 's/^(\s*brewinandchewin\s*=\s*)true/\1false/' config/creativebrewing-common.toml
> reload
sleep 15
shell grep -q "members on: vinery$\|members on: vinery\b[^,]" logs/kubejs/server.log
shell sed -i -E 's/^(\s*brewinandchewin\s*=\s*)false/\1true/' config/creativebrewing-common.toml
> reload
sleep 15
look server log says `members on: vinery` after the first reload; set back to true and reloaded
